	(text "HV WARNING: 288-403 V DC is lethal. Bench-test only on a current-limited supply behind an isolation transformer. Do not defeat Leaf contactors/interlocks/BMS." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 40 10 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "4b5113d1-a1ee-4f54-b488-e97ae490563b"))
	(text "Controller lives on the 14 V (secondary) side; primary FETs driven through isolated drivers; bias for primary side from isolated DC-DC U6." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 40 14 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "5f4304e4-b030-430c-84af-b3b0d4950eba"))
	(text "Start-up: needs 12 V on J2 (bench supply or vehicle 12 V battery) to boot the ESP32; U6/U4/U5 then run from VCTRL, D4 takes over from the output." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 40 18 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "15ca0e98-3716-46bd-ae86-372e69fb1e41"))
	(text "Open items: hardware over-current latch to DRV_DIS, phase-shift/ZVS tuning (LR1), sync-rect timing, HV creepage/clearance, thermal. Generic symbols: map pins to datasheets." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 40 22 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "4e559d36-43a8-45ca-91eb-bc168b20c700"))
